1
00:00:00,445 --> 00:00:01,895
(Penny:)Sweetie, I'm so sorry.

2
00:00:02,046 --> 00:00:03,686
(Penny:)I wish there was something I could do
to make you feel better.

3
00:00:03,882 --> 00:00:08,062
(Leonard:)-I do, too, but there's not.
-Really? Are you sure about that?

4
00:00:11,589 --> 00:00:14,089
(Leonard:)Of course, who am I to argue
with a check-plus student?

5
00:00:16,127 --> 00:00:17,607
(Leonard:)Just warning you,
I'm gonna go right.

6
00:00:17,762 --> 00:00:19,542
(Leonard:)Don't make a big deal out of it.

7
00:00:28,473 --> 00:00:30,143
(Stuart:)Is make-up really necessary?

8
00:00:30,942 --> 00:00:33,152
(Raj:)Well, when someone looks
at your dating profile,

9
00:00:33,278 --> 00:00:34,818
(Raj:)the first thing they see is
your picture.

10
00:00:35,213 --> 00:00:37,453
(Raj:)I just want to make sure
you look fun and full of life

11
00:00:37,615 --> 00:00:40,495
(Raj:)and not like a body
they just pulled out of the river.

12
00:00:41,719 --> 00:00:46,099
(Raj:)All right, here we go,
and... smile.

13
00:00:48,559 --> 00:00:49,899
(CAMERA CLICKS)

14
00:00:51,462 --> 00:00:53,802
Okay. That one's in the bank.

15
00:00:54,799 --> 00:00:58,249
(Raj:)How about this? Turn away,
and then tum back into it.

